Synthesized Audio Assets (`app/assets/ambient/*.wav`)
-----------------------------------------------------
The 5 ambient background audio beds (`office.wav`, `call_center.wav`,
`coffee_shop.wav`, `convention_hall.wav`, `summer_outdoor.wav`) are procedural
